	<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
		<defName>RG_Thrinaxodon</defName>
		<label>thrinaxodon</label>
		<description>A small carnivorous synapsid roughly similar in size to foxes with diets that typically consist of insects and small herbivores. Their tendency to burrow helped them survive through one of the mass extinction events back on Earth.\n\nThe Thrinaxodon is native to Tundra and Boreal Forest regions, able to survive the cold both due to their fur and burrowing habits. They are also a social creature and often found in packs, which usually result in them hunting larger prey when there is a lack of suitable low-risk sustenance.</description>
